			"width": 1600,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "# Arthur\nArthur Thorne, publisher of Vellum & Vine, a tall man in his late forties, dark hair greying at the temples, rumpled tweed jacket, tired grief in his eyes\n\nEverything about Arthur, top to bottom. Right-click a recipe card to make its art; it saves into `characters/arthur/art/`. Make them in order: room and actor, then the moods, then the talking loops, then the booth."
