			"x": 700,
			"y": 5000,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 460,
			"text": "## arthur-at-desk\nedit\nstatus: done\nmodel: qwen-edit\nsize: 1024x1024\nseed: 31\nprompt: \"Show the same person, with the same face, grey hair, glasses and clothes, now seated behind a 1970s Italian modern desk, a cool older man who collects retro modern furniture. The desk is a long, low, sculptural Italian design piece: a glossy white lacquer top with rounded edges on polished chrome legs. On it: a curved orange space-age desk lamp, a few neat manuscripts, a smoked-glass ashtray. He sits in a tan leather and chrome Italian swivel chair, a pen in his hand, looking at the camera. Straight-on front view, the camera square to the desk at seated eye level: the front edge of the desk is perfectly horizontal and parallel to the bottom of the picture, both ends of the desk at the same height, the desk top barely visible. The whole desk, lamp and chair fit in the frame with empty space on both sides. No green objects. Flat, evenly lit pure green screen background, no floor, no shadow, no walls.\"\n",
			"color": "4"
		},
