			"text": "## arthur-at-desk-amber\nedit\nstatus: idea\nmodel: qwen-edit\nsize: 1024x1024\nseed: 25\n# Not used now: the 70s desk has no green. A green lamp shade vanishes with the green screen, so it becomes amber.\nprompt: \"Change only the green glass shade of the desk lamp into warm amber glass. Keep everything else exactly the same: the man, the desk, the papers, the framing, and the flat green screen background.\"\n",
